</section><section class="vc_custom_1718705161871"><div class="container"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid section-wrapper, feedback-products vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-o-content-top vc_row-flex"><div class="feature-section-text-left wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://www.feedbackwhiz.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FeedbackWhiz_Icon-72x72.png" width="72" height="72" alt="FeedbackWhiz_Icon" title="FeedbackWhiz_Icon"/></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 style="text-align: center;">FeedbackWhiz Emails</h4>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Boosting a product’s review average from three to four stars can <a href="https://www.mckinsey.com/industries/consumer-packaged-goods/our-insights/five-star-growth-using-online-ratings-to-design-better-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">increase sales by 24%</a>. That’s why FW Emails does everything possible to get feedback for you while staying fully Amazon compliant.</p>
<p>Automate product review and seller feedback requests with your preferred method:</p>
<ul>
<li>Use Amazon’s Buyer-Seller Messaging. Create tailored review request campaigns or use our pre-built, customizable templates.</li>
<li>Automate the &#8220;Request a Review&#8221; button to send requests in Amazon’s own language.</li>
</ul>
<p>Either way, you’re backed by advanced automation features and analytics.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  text-center">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 class="button-feature"><a class="btn btn--primary type--uppercase hero-buttons" href="https://www.feedbackwhiz.com/features/emails/" rel="noopener noreferrer">LEARN MORE</a></h4>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="feature-section-text-left wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-4 vc_col-lg-3 vc_col-md-offset-0 vc_col-md-3"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://www.feedbackwhiz.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FW_Alerts_Icon-72x72.png" width="72" height="72" alt="FW_Alerts_Icon" title="FW_Alerts_Icon"/></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 style="text-align: center;">FeedbackWhiz Alerts</h4>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Something as seemingly small as a bad review or unwarranted product flag can rapidly turn from a nuisance into a disaster. Defend your business with FW Alerts.</p>
<p>Know what&#8217;s happening in your seller account and listings right away. Be warned whenever hijackers jump on your listings or competitors win the buy box. Get updates on reviews, feedback, price shifts, and more.</p>
<p>With FW Alerts, you can spot small problems and solve them before they have a chance to grow.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  text-center">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 class="button-feature"><a class="btn btn--primary type--uppercase hero-buttons" href="https://www.feedbackwhiz.com/features/alerts/" rel="noopener noreferrer">LEARN MORE</a></h4>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="feature-section-text-left wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img class="vc_single_image-img " src="https://www.feedbackwhiz.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FWProfitAnalytics_Icon-72x72.png" width="72" height="72" alt="FWProfitAnalytics_Icon" title="FWProfitAnalytics_Icon"/></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 style="text-align: center;">FeedbackWhiz Profits</h4>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Selling on Amazon just got easier. FW Profits consolidates your sales, uncovers hidden fees, and tracks customized expenses—all in one place.</p>
<p>Monitor your revenue and finances based on your exact needs. Group costs based on categories relevant to your business.</p>
<p>See how well each of your listings performs to gain insights that will enhance your profit margins.</p>
<p>From easy-to-understand charts to detailed reports, FW Profits has what you need to make better decisions fast.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  text-center">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
