		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></section><section class="bg--secondary"><div class="container"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row-o-content-top vc_row-flex"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-2"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-8"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h2 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Make better decisions and react faster with our new Walmart seller tools</strong></h2>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 24px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3 class="lead" style="text-align: center;">If you’re a Walmart Marketplace seller, then you know that staying constantly informed on your listings and profit margins is crucial. That’s where FW Alerts and FW Profits step in.</h3>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-2"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid section-wrapper feature-section-reverse vc_row-o-content-middle vc_row-flex"><div class="feature-section-text-left wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3>Monitor reviews with ease via FW Alerts</h3>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 24px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Receive instant alerts when someone leaves a product review. Reach out to that customer right away to avoid escalation and protect your brand. Customize the triggers for your notifications to focus on positive, neutral, or negative ratings.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 40px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  text-center, button-feature">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4 class="button-feature"><a class="btn btn--primary type--uppercase hero-buttons" href="https://www.feedbackwhiz.com/features/alerts/" rel="noopener noreferrer">LEARN MORE</a></h4>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="image-margin wpb_column vc_column_container col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><iframe style="border-radius: 12px;" title="Streamline Your Walmart Reviews and Alerts with FeedbackWhiz" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/sJno--5liQ4" width="640" height="360" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></p>

